1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,710
M: The boss wants me to change the setting of our office before the president's visit next month.

2
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:09,050
He wants me to utilize the space here by moving the furniture around.

3
00:00:09,995 --> 00:00:13,250
I am not very good at this, so I need your expert advice.

4
00:00:14,075 --> 00:00:16,410
Can you spare some time to discuss the office layout?

5
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:19,130
W: Well, I am kind of busy today.

6
00:00:19,490 --> 00:00:23,770
Let me see... this Thursday or next Monday is good for me.

7
00:00:23,830 --> 00:00:24,685
What about you?

8
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:27,270
M: I have to leave town for a week on Friday.

9
00:00:27,775 --> 00:00:29,910
I think we'd better get together before I leave.

10
00:00:30,210 --> 00:00:31,110
Is that okay with you?

11
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:34,090
W: That will be fine as long as it's in the morning.

12
00:00:34,370 --> 00:00:36,930
I have to leave early for a dentist appointment in the afternoon.
